id: pm-slack-7hrn
title: "Bound sleep helper so setTimeout never receives an unbounded server-controlled delay (CodeQL js/resource-exhaustion, index.ts:1176)"
description: ""
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-03T17:28:11.285Z"
